      "content": "i keep looking at this photo from my 7th birthday and something feels so wrong. in the pic i'm at a beach in florida but i have this incredibly vivid memory of being in a snowy cabin during that same week. like i can actually feel the cold and smell the pine. i looked up my old school records and they say i was in florida that year too. what if my memories aren't actually mine? like what if they've been tampered with?",
